# Tacit coding
AddTwo ← add 2
AddFour = fork AddTwo AddTwo

# Stack manipulation
self mul 5
by add 2 5
on add 2 5
dip neg 2 5

# Subscripts
pow 2 3
pow__₂ 3

# Modifiers
rows join [1 2 3] [4 5 6]
reduce mul [1 2 3]

# Conditionals
switch(5|7) 0
switch(5|7) 1
switch(5|7) [0 1 0]
switch(-3|+2) [1 0 1] [4 5 6]
switch min__3 add__2 [1 0 1] [4 5 6]
